                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>1. Employee Attendance Data is taken from the IT Turnstile system</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>2. Absence data is from Workday. Only Approved Absence is considered</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>3. Business trip data is only availale until December 2024. 2025 data does not include Business trips. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Integration:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
